@ name, header, previous / current / next code, labels -> draws the account
@ view straight into PICT (see HDRAW).  Codes via DCODES; countdown via DTICK.
\<< \-> name hdr pc code nc lbls
  \<<
    ERASE
    PICT { #0d #0d } name 2 \->GROB REPL
    hdr 2 \->GROB DUP SIZE DROP #131d SWAP - #0d 2 \->LIST PICT SWAP ROT REPL
    pc code nc DCODES
    PICT { #0d #56d } lbls REPL
  \>>
\>>
